{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54cfb75bd03609c8fc389fe6d244b434f2ae7473dfadf07274ff1d940033245e", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n雪歩は大人っぽいパジャマを着るのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的日子。\n雪步要穿一身成熟风格的睡衣，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99d5e0c0f95cb8b75e72ca90e13dbb171befa8e3a4963e8c7feac145cb80fa69", "ja": "うぅ……お、お茶……。お茶を飲めばぁぁ……。", "zh": "呜……茶、茶……只要喝了茶的话啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "892820da522b60b2544ba9fedd5944e537e82ff366c09ec1bf2eacf97526f6ce", "ja": "雪歩……！？　大丈夫か？\nお茶なら淹れてくるけど……。", "zh": "雪步……！？没事吧？\n要是想喝茶的话，我去给你泡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bb5e21f845813ebf8cca45d572f7afd81638a88d846ba445dac61b678d8cf672", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……！\n心配かけちゃってごめんなさい。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……！\n让你担心了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f27c8b2da50f6c14a5da7f497e3a607181eeab4d21c123d26e32b1d59424c644", "ja": "撮影前なのに、気になることができて。\nそしたら、急に不安になっちゃって……。", "zh": "明明马上就要拍摄了，却突然有了在意的事情。\n然后就一下子变得不安起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2049a89feb5118c9d23bc0488f52383bd371921cfc70ea5dcf76b3b868b49b41", "ja": "気になること？", "zh": "在意的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "180cf26c923c8438657356fda7c30cd1d4961acb1908cefcf8f17a970e1f7ede", "ja": "そ、その……大人の人ってみんな、\nこういうパジャマで寝てるんでしょうか……。", "zh": "那、那个……大人是不是都穿这种睡衣睡觉的呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4265e7a1919d3ee91324921531adf67ee0174d3a2b3159745641f05fd721bdc2", "ja": "よく考えたら、ひんそーでちんちくりんな私には、\nこのパジャマ、セクシーすぎるって言うか。", "zh": "仔细想想，对于我这种身材单薄又矮小的人来说，这套睡衣是不是太性感了点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d60c07de089a011cd4d38eb61827b886271d3bebfc08f913a13960f9ee08982c", "ja": "ドキドキしちゃって……\n私だったらきっと全然眠れないと思うんですぅ。", "zh": "心里怦怦直跳……要是我的话，肯定完全睡不着的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a41b307a475a429223f03885d49882c445eb09c035285303cbb3d7c0cc00e1a6", "ja": "いや、大人がみんなそういうパジャマってわけじゃ\nないよ。好きなパジャマでいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不，大人倒也不是都穿那种睡衣\n啦。穿自己喜欢的睡衣不就好了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cf612251c5461c824feb6f3ab367a92648a97bbed73f97ccda493dee058c632c", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8574b2b3af9e182a47f59eb6c0b1ea7c466894fd5fad8441debadd097192a914", "ja": "いつか私も……って想像したら、\n急に不安になってきちゃって……。", "zh": "一想到总有一天我也……\n就突然变得很不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16562802a5b83baa95c1921a889ac67a296431bde27b38aa56c8140972242cf2", "ja": "そう考えてたら、なんだか今日の撮影も、\n私なんかで本当に大丈夫なのかなって……。", "zh": "这样一想，总觉得今天的拍摄也让我开始担心，真的由我来做没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1013_p", "source_sha256": "00b1adfcd29e756acec16613d407c40f769aa87821560cf971b14cddb7d96fd4", "ja": "なるほど、そんな風に思ってたんだな。\nでも、それなら……", "zh": "原来你是这么想的啊。不过，既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0453_1014", "source_sha256": "d3a3d7ea51e8defcd01039c41897a01c31084c93e4ec638b155f4220a7fe965d", "ja": "大丈夫！", "zh": "没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
